whole board, as in chess (Black's right live):  White-first wins = True  White-second wins = False -> class N
sum of components (right survives elsewhere):  White-first wins = False  White-second wins = False -> class R
components: [([(0, 4)], [(1, 4)], ((0, 3), (0, 4), 'B')), ([(5, 4)], [(4, 5)], None)]
repo pure whole  : {0 | -4, -3±2} N
